## 📌 `display()` → Print all elements
```c
void display() {
    struct Node* temp = front;
    if (temp == NULL) {
        printf("Queue is empty\n");
        return;
    }
    printf("Queue: ");
    while (temp != NULL) {   // move from front to rear
        printf("%d ", temp->data);
        temp = temp->next;
    }
    printf("\n");
}
```
👉 **Think:** Just walk through the line and read everyone’s ticket number.  

